    IF @@ROWCOUNT = 0 INSERT ... (external_ref, estatus, estatus_calypso, date_out, tipo, msg_out, msg_id_out) VALUES (...);
  COMMIT; END TRY BEGIN CATCH ...existing logging... THROW; END CATCH END
Benefit: a redelivered or duplicated message cannot create a second settlement candidate, and malformed messages are visible instead of becoming rows. Suggested JIRA: CCN-5 (Major). Related: FCM-FR-2 (phantom row on the next response).
